entityDescription:
MAINDATA established in 1996 brings innovative products to TV broadcast and satellite internet. It attracted worldwide customer base including Eurovision / European Broadcasting Union Geneva, World Bank I.B.R.D Washington D.C., USA, Tatanet India, Katelco Alma-aty Kazakhstan, Sony and others. 

MAINDATA manufactures in-house built hardware and develops software solutions. Product range evolved from satellite internet, via eLearning up to innovative television signal delivery (satellite, terrestrial). 2 new products are providing significant operational costs savings to Television Broadcasters. Savings range from 60 to 97% presenting several hundred thousands per year. 

Highlights: 
&bull;
Seal of Excellence award by EIC Accelerator Horizon 2020 for the most innovative European SMEs 
&bull;
Cooperation at European digital TV standardization group DVB based in Geneva. 
&bull;
R&D certified by Slovak Ministry of Education Partner of Research Institute for Telecommunications 
&bull;
Frost & Sullivan Excellence and Innovation award for mobile TV product lines
